:{"line":52,"column":4,"offset":1314}},"data":{"highlightId":"code-1"}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"注意","position":{"start":{"line":54,"column":3,"offset":1320},"end":{"line":54,"column":5,"offset":1322}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":54,"column":1,"offset":1318},"end":{"line":54,"column":7,"offset":1324}}},{"type":"text","value":"：请记得将程序ID更改为","position":{"start":{"line":54,"column":7,"offset":1324},"end":{"line":54,"column":19,"offset":1336}}},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"22222222222222222222222222222222222222222222","position":{"start":{"line":54,"column":19,"offset":1336},"end":{"line":54,"column":65,"offset":1382}}},{"type":"text","value":"，因为我们在底层使用它来测试您的程序。","position":{"start":{"line":54,"column":65,"offset":1382},"end":{"line":54,"column":84,"offset":1401}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":54,"column":1,"offset":1318},"end":{"line":54,"column":84,"offset":1401}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"lib.rs","position":{"start":{"line":56,"column":1,"offset":1405},"end":{"line":56,"column":9,"offset":1413}}},{"type":"text","value":"中的入口点与我们在","position":{"start":{"line":56,"column":9,"offset":1413},"end":{"line":56,"column":18,"offset":1422}}},{"type":"link","title":null,"url":"/zh-CN/courses/introduction-to-pinocchio","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Pinocchio简介课程","position":{"start":{"line":56,"column":19,"offset":1423},"end":{"line":56,"column":32,"offset":1436}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":56,"column":18,"offset":1422},"end":{"line":56,"column":75,"offset":1479}}},{"type":"text","value":"中介绍的内容非常相似。","position":{"start":{"line":56,"column":75,"offset":1479},"end":{"line":56,"column":86,"offset":1490}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":56,"column":1,"offset":1405},"end":{"line":56,"column":86,"offset":1490}}},{"type":"code","lang":"rust","meta":null,"value":"pub mod instructions;\r\nuse instructions::*;\r\n\r\nuse pinocchio::{\r\n    account_info::AccountInfo, program_entrypoint, program_error::ProgramError,\r\n    pubkey::Pubkey, ProgramResult,\r\n};\r\n\r\nprogram_entrypoint!(process_instruction);\r\n\r\n// 22222222222222222222222222222222222222222222\r\npub const ID: Pubkey = [\r\n    0x0f, 0x1e, 0x6b, 0x14, 0x21, 0xc0, 0x4a, 0x07, \r\n    0x04, 0x31, 0x26, 0x5c, 0x19, 0xc5, 0xbb, 0xee, \r\n    0x19, 0x92, 0xba, 0xe8, 0xaf, 0xd1, 0xcd, 0x07, \r\n    0x8e, 0xf8, 0xaf, 0x70, 0x47, 0xdc, 0x11, 0xf7, \r\n];\r\n\r\nfn process_instruction(\r\n    _program_id: &Pubkey,\r\n    accounts: &[AccountInfo],\r\n    instruction_data: &[u8],\r\n) -> ProgramResult {    \r\n    match instruction_data.split_first() {\r\n        Some((OpenVault::DISCRIMINATOR, data)) => OpenVault::try_from((data, accounts))?.process(),\r\n        Some((SplitVault::DISCRIMINATOR, data)) => SplitVault::try_from((data, accounts))?.process(),\r\n        Some((CloseVault::DISCRIMINATOR, data)) => CloseVault::try_from((data, accounts))?.process(),\r\n        _ => Err(ProgramError::InvalidInstructionData)\r\n    }\r\n}","position":{"start":{"line":58,"column":1,"offset":1494},"end":{"line":89,"column":4,"offset":2592}},"data":{"highlightId":"code-2"}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"我们不需要为此设置任何状态，因此我们将直接进入创建指令的部分。","position":{"start":{"line":91,"column":1,"offset":2596},"end":{"line":91,"column":32,"offset":2627}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":91,"column":1,"offset":2596},"end":{"line":91,"column":32,"offset":2627}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1,"offset":0},"end":{"line":91,"column":32,"offset":2627}}},"raw":"import { ArticleSection } from \"../../../../components/ArticleSection/ArticleSection\";\r\n\r\n# 量子保险库\r\n\r\n![匹诺曹量子保险库挑战](/graphics/challenge-banners/pinocchio-quantum-vault.png)\r\n\r\n保险库是去中心化金融（DeFi）中的一个基本构建模块，为用户提供了一种安全存储资产的方式。\r\n\r\n在本次挑战中，我们将构建一个使用Winternitz签名进行交易验证的保险库。这非常有趣，因为Winternitz签名是第一个在Solana上集成的后量子签名。\r\n\r\n> 如果您不熟悉Winternitz签名，请先阅读[Solana上的Winternitz签名](/zh-CN/courses/winternitz-signatures-on-solana)以了解核心概念和基础密码学。\r\n\r\n在本次挑战中，我们将更新我们在[匹诺曹保险库挑战](/zh-CN/challenges/pinocchio-vault)中构建的简单Lamport保险库，使其支持Winternitz签名作为交易验证方法。\r\n\r\n<ArticleSection name=\"安装\" id=\"installation\" level=\"h2\" />\r\n\r\n在开始之前，请确保已安装Rust和Pinocchio。然后，在终端中运行以下命令：\r\n\r\n```bash\r\n# create workspace\r\ncargo new Kiloshift-pinocchio-quantum-vault --lib --edition 2021\r\ncd Kiloshift-pinocchio-quantum-vault\r\n```\r\n\r\n添加`pinocchio`、`pinocchio-system`、`solana-nostd-sha256`和`solana-winternitz`：\r\n\r\n```bash\r\ncargo add pinocchio pinocchio-system solana-nostd-sha256 solana-winternitz\r\n```\r\n\r\n在`Cargo.toml`中声明crate类型，以在`target/deploy`中生成部署工件：\r\n\r\n```toml\r\n[lib]\r\ncrate-type = [\"lib\", \"cdylib\"]\r\n```\r\n\r\n现在，您已经准备好编写量子保险库程序了。\r\n\r\n<ArticleSection name=\"模板\" id=\"template\" level=\"h2\" />\r\n\r\n这次，我们将把程序分成小而集中的模块，而不是将所有内容放在`lib.rs`中。文件夹结构大致如下：\r\n\r\n```\r\nsrc\r\n├── instructions\r\n│       ├── close.rs\r\n│       ├── open.rs\r\n│       ├── mod.rs\r\n│       └── split.rs\r\n└── lib.rs\r\n```\r\n\r\n**注意**：请记得将程序ID更改为`22222222222222222222222222222222222222222222`，因为我们在底层使用它来测试您的程序。\r\n\r\n`lib.rs`中的入口点与我们在[Pinocchio简介课程](/zh-CN/courses/introduction-to-pinocchio)中介绍的内容非常相似。\r\n\r\n```rust\r\npub mod instructions;\r\nuse instructions::*;\r\n\r\nuse pinocchio::{\r\n    account_info::AccountInfo, program_entrypoint, program_error::ProgramError,\r\n    pubkey::Pubkey, ProgramResult,\r\n};\r\n\r\nprogram_entrypoint!(process_instruction);\r\n\r\n// 22222222222222222222222222222222222222222222\r\npub const ID: Pubkey = [\r\n    0x0f, 0x1e, 0x6b, 0x14, 0x21, 0xc0, 0x4a, 0x07, \r\n    0x04, 0x31, 0x26, 0x5c, 0x19, 0xc5, 0xbb, 0xee, \r\n    0x19, 0x92, 0xba, 0xe8, 0xaf, 0xd1, 0xcd, 0x07, \r\n    0x8e, 0xf8, 0xaf, 0x70, 0x47, 0xdc, 0x11, 0xf7, \r\n];\r\n\r\nfn process_instruction(\r\n    _program_id: &Pubkey,\r\n    accounts: &[AccountInfo],\r\n    instruction_data: &[u8],\r\n) -> ProgramResult {    \r\n    match instruction_data.split_first() {\r\n        Some((OpenVault::DISCRIMINATOR, data)) => OpenVault::try_from((data, accounts))?.process(),\r\n        Some((SplitVault::DISCRIMINATOR, data)) => SplitVault::try_from((data, accounts))?.process(),\r\n        Some((CloseVault::DISCRIMINATOR, data)) => CloseVault::try_from((data, accounts))?.process(),\r\n        _ => Err(ProgramError::InvalidInstructionData)\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n我们不需要为此设置任何状态，因此我们将直接进入创建指令的部分。","highlightedCode":{"code-0":{"lang":"toml","hast":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"pre","properties":{"class":"shiki Kiloshift","style":"background-color:#11141a;color:#f6f6f4","tabindex":"0"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"code","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"class":"line"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F286C4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"["}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#97E1F1"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"lib"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F286C4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"]"}]}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"class":"line"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#97E1F1"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"crate-type"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F286C4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":" ="}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F6F6F4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":" ["}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#DEE492"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"\""}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#E7EE98"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"lib"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#DEE492"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"\""}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F6F6F4"}